  "notes": "Official Kobelco Europe spec (CKE2500G-4; -3 datasheet not found on official site, -4 is the current version). Source has 26 boom columns (15.2-91.4 m); 12 kept. Kobelco cells \"R m/value\" (min/max radius of that boom) added as extra rows at their exact radius. Ratings per EN13000; hook block and slings must be deducted. Chart counterweight 90.4 t (spec table lists 91,000 kg) + carbody 27.5 t. Dims p.7 (mm): track overall length 8,970 (tumbler centres 7,895), width over 1,220 mm shoes 7,620, track height 1,360, tail swing R6,000, boom foot 1,400 ahead of slew centre. trackGauge_m = 7.62 - 1.22 = 6.40 m (derived). Boom foot pin height not clearly dimensioned - left null."
